[2026-09-24 11:01:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 145]   step_145: transfer-function discriminator (result b109).
[2026-09-24 11:01:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 145]   The observed periapsis rotation is converted to an equivalent time
[2026-09-24 11:01:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 145]   scale by dt_eq = dtheta * r_b^2 / h (step_065).  Two microscopic
[2026-09-24 11:01:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 145]   realizations produce that observable:
[2026-09-24 11:01:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 145]   - impulse realization: a conformal fifth-force kick across a lapse
[2026-09-24 11:01:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 145]   wall, dv = c^2 Da / v_n along the wall normal.  It predicts
[2026-09-24 11:01:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 145]   (a) dtheta ~ 1/(v_n v), so the implied slip dt = dtheta/Omega is
[2026-09-24 11:01:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 145]   strongly anticorrelated with crossing speed, and (b) an along-
[2026-09-24 11:01:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 145]   track component that changes orbital energy at
[2026-09-24 11:01:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 145]   D(1/a) = 2 v dv_par / GM.
[2026-09-24 11:01:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 145]   - holonomy realization: a crossing-localized time translation
[2026-09-24 11:01:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 145]   (non-integrable time transport, H = oint_C dtau).  It predicts a
[2026-09-24 11:01:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 145]   universal dt independent of crossing velocity and zero local
[2026-09-24 11:01:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 145]   impulse, so the energy channel stays flat.
[2026-09-24 11:01:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 145]   Tests on the independent dual-leg refit records (steps_127/128):
[2026-09-24 11:01:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 145]   - T1: Spearman rho(dtau, v_rx) at shells r_x = 60/100/250 AU, in and
[2026-09-24 11:01:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 145]   out of each era's anomaly cap, both eras.  Flat selects holonomy.
[2026-09-24 11:01:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 145]   - T2: transverse-fraction bound -- the rotation requires
[2026-09-24 11:01:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 145]   dv_perp = v * dtheta while the flat energy channel bounds
[2026-09-24 11:01:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 145]   |dv_par| <= GM D(1/a)/(2v).  The required transverse fraction of
[2026-09-24 11:01:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 145]   any mechanical kick.
[2026-09-24 11:01:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 145]   - T3: implied conformal-step scale Da ~ dv_perp v / c^2.
